    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">a Game About Acting and Performance. </h2><br>Romp through levels with moves based on the mask you choose at the start, but make sure the mask matches the narrator's description!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Joy: double jump, as well as holding jump for a slower descent. <br></li><li>Confusion: grappling hook, swing left and right and release to travel across pits.<br></li><li>Rage: strike the wall to send yourself flying backwards.<br></li><li>Sorrow: store your falling momentum and spring into the air again.</li></ul><br>Dialogue options over a narrative driven platformer, with many easter eggs scattered about.<br><br>Join the Discord server:<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1963130/extras/b11d691086f4825227035696b556df43.avif?t=1722781645\" /></div>",
